{"title":"North York Indoor Soccer","startsAt":"2026-11-20T21:15:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-20T22:45:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**🚨IMPORTANT UPDATE - READ BEFORE RSVPing🚨**\nWe’ve launched our new website: [www.soccertoronto.ca](http://www.soccertoronto.ca/) **All sign‑ups must now be completed through the website.** Meetup reservations **do NOT** confirm your spot.\nThere is **no texting or emailing to sign up anymore.** All program information, registration, rules, and updates are now on the website.\n**Do NOT show up without signing up in advance — you will be turned away.**\n\n**HOW TO SIGN UP**\n👉 Register online at [www.soccertoronto.ca](http://www.soccertoronto.ca/)\n👉 Payments must be sent to [payment@soccertoronto.ca](mailto:payment@soccertoronto.ca)\n👉 For general questions only, email [info@soccertoronto.ca](mailto:info@soccertoronto.ca)\n\n**TORONTO’S BEST INDOOR PICKUP SOCCER**\nHosted by **Soccer Toronto** — Est. 2008\n\n**FALL/WINTER SCHEDULE**\n\n* **Fridays** — 9:15 to 10:45 PM\n\nPickup soccer runs weekly at **Crecent School**, **2365 Bayview Ave, North York ON M2L 1A2 (Bayview & Lawrence)**.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://share.google/WKVjgBaRJUrt2s0nI\n\nWe welcome skilled regulars and new players every week. There is always a game.\n\n**PROGRAM DETAILS**\n\n* **Format:** 7v7 - 3 Fields - 7 Teams Max\n* **Level:** All players welcome (Beginner to Advanced)\n* **Cost:** **$25/player** — *payment required in advance*\n* **Payment Email:** payments@soccertoronto.ca\n* **Register Online:** www.soccertoronto.ca\n\n**WHAT TO BRING**\n\n* Indoor turf shoes (no cleats)\n* Shin guards recommended\n* Water\n* Jerseys/pinnies/balls are provided\n\nMeet the organizer on the first field when you enter the facility.\n\n**REMINDER**\n\n**Meetup RSVP = NOT a confirmed spot.** Only website registrations count.\nSpace is limited — register early.","venue":{"name":"Crescent School","address":"2365 Bayview Ave, North York, ON M2L 1A2, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.732505,"lng":-79.379243,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Soccer Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/2/6/highres_536161574.jpeg"}